      {
        "tuple": "pr create",
        "platform": [
          "macos",
          "linux"
        ],
        "reasoning": "Speech tier, the same authority class as issue create: opening a pull request proposes a change under the bot identity and lands nothing. Merging stays on the admin pr merge row. The head branch must be in the target repository; cross-repository (owner:branch) heads are refused."
      },
      {
